{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-1","kind":"proposition","title":"直线不能一部分在平面内而另一部分离开平面","englishTitle":"A part of a straight line cannot be in the plane of reference and a part in a plane more elevated.","book":11,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-1@raw-521a0f0f4acbf1cb","contentId":"euclid-11-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"521a0f0f4acbf1cb68f63a50442c68ec2198957814be2bf6684219ccb5d8e2f7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-1.statement","euclid-11-1.proof.1","euclid-11-1.proof.2","euclid-11-1.construction.1","euclid-11-1.conclusion","euclid-11-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-1","revisionId":"euclid-11-1@raw-521a0f0f4acbf1cb","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dd94b459d3791c624235fa2e9d882553786c24ae2709e415513fd1eb3ccd2c46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A part of a straight line cannot be in the plane of reference and a part in a plane more elevated."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线的一部分不能在参考的平面上,而不能在平面上加高。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-1","revisionId":"euclid-11-1@raw-521a0f0f4acbf1cb","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc7f02c24eb159edd17729a66179f7cc5d15cfaafa0a2108d23945461fc7d67c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let a part AB of the straight line ABC be in the plane of reference, and a part BC in a plane more elevated."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,将直线 ABC第AB部分置于参考平面,将第BC部分置于平面高点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-1","revisionId":"euclid-11-1@raw-521a0f0f4acbf1cb","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c8056178f9791d5dab6df13d82b8dd9d66fe2e1d8c7e8b337e793ec2d99d791","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"There will then be in the plane of reference some straight line continuous with AB in a straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,在参考文献的平面中,将有一些直线,以AB为直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-1","revisionId":"euclid-11-1@raw-521a0f0f4acbf1cb","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a0323fb6cd78ba9c54a6eec7b3ed0dbc8cfac0e5ba4d6d198c444a88e3fe8ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be BD; therefore AB is a common segment of the two straight lines ABC, ABD: which is impossible, inasmuch as, if we describe a circle with centre B and distance AB, the diameters will cut off unequal circumferences of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它为BD;因此,AB是两条直线ABC、ABD的共同部分:这是不可能的,因为如果我们描述一个以B和AB为中心、距离的圆圈,直径将切断圆圈的不平等环绕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-1","revisionId":"euclid-11-1@raw-521a0f0f4acbf1cb","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"376569cd56b348d38ec74c2197774f2c9de2c23fc544cc435ad4dd0a34091431","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a part of a straight line cannot be in the plane of reference, and a part in a plane more elevated. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,一条直线的一部分不能在参考的平面线内,而不能在平面高点内。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-1.source","contentId":"euclid-11-1","revisionId":"euclid-11-1@raw-521a0f0f4acbf1cb","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a603a53313784a5a8f462799826653b469fcf2e130c9c1dc240c8e70cc6c385e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-2:euclid-11-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-2.proof.2","euclid-11-2.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"XI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-16:euclid-11-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-16.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"XI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-11-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-17.proof.14"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"XI. 1"}}],"dependencies":[],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-2:euclid-11-1:explicit","id":"euclid-11-2","book":11,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"两条相交直线确定一个平面","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-16:euclid-11-1:explicit","id":"euclid-11-16","book":11,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-11-1:explicit","id":"euclid-13-17","book":13,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正十二面体","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
